# The release package is a SHA-256 content digest of the files on disk. If the
# working copy's line endings depend on the platform, so does the package
# identity: a digest computed on Windows (CRLF) will not match the same commit
# checked out on a Linux runner (LF), and the deployment workflow's
# --expect-digest assertion would fail for a reason that has nothing to do with
# the content.
#
# Every file in this repository is text, and every checkout gets LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
